### 邀请成员
POST {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/base/member/invite
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "knowledgeBaseId": 2,
  "username": "lisi",
  "memberRole": 2
}

### 更改成员角色
PUT {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/base/member/update-role
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "knowledgeBaseId": 2,
  "id": 1,
  "memberRole": 1
}

### 移除成员
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/base/member/delete?knowledgeBaseId=2&id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获取成员列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/base/member/list?knowledgeBaseId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
